~ start
Hannibal: I've been looking for you.
P: Have we met?
Hannibal: I've killed you countless times before. But this moment in time keeps repeating.
Hannibal: End this fight, why do you keep coming back?
- I've never been here before
	P: I've never been here before, I would remember something like this
	Hannibal: So you lose your memory each time?
	Hannibal: I suppose some creater put me here for a purpose...
	Hannibal: to kill you.
- How would I be dead if I'm standing right here
	P: If I died I wouldn't be standing here
	Hannibal: You still walk, but it wall always end the same just as before
	Hannibal: You will die, again and again. Today will be no different.
do! playResume("e2")

Hannibal: You will die
set Global.cutsceneStarted = false
=> END

~ P2
Hannibal: Gods. Devils. Indulge me and feed me your strength.
Hannibal: Ensure they cannot cross any further and end our realm
Hannibal: They must rot and be trapped here forever
Hannibal: ...
Hannibal: Tell me...
Hannibal: If you complete your mission, but I leave a mark on your memory...
Hannibal: Do I really cease to exist?...
Hannibal: Doesn't matter really...as you won't get that far.
do! playResume("clash", true)
do Global.ap.play("clashing")
do Global.UI.Clash.Start()
do! Global.clashing()
if Global.clash_won:
	do! Global.ap.play("clashW")
	do! Global.apFinish()
	do! Resume()
	Hannibal: *cough* *cough* All... All for a test, right?
	Hannibal: Guess I should at least give you a show.
else:
	do! Global.ap.play("clashL")
	do! Global.apFinish()
	do! Resume()
	Hannibal: its over.
=> END

